<title>CANADA: Wheat, barley down in CWB's latest pool return.</title>
<headline>Wheat, barley down in CWB's latest pool return.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat prices were down $3 to $5 per tonne and feed barley prices were down $5 to $7 in the Canadian Wheat Board's September Estimated Pool Return (EPR).</p>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board released Thursday its latest EPR for the 1995-96 crop year. The feed barley EPR was down $5 and designated six-row barley was down $1.</p>
